    "id": "hurufi.production.literacy.wave10",
    "title": "Literacy path — Wave 10",
    "description": "Tenth production literacy slice: madd-alif (fatha + alif). Compact two-unit wave. Contrast short ba vs long baa, then decode bab. No new consonant. Function-word laa and dajaj are postponed. No hamza, kasra, damma, long waw/ya, or Wave 11.",
    "notProductionCurriculum": false
  },
